1
00:00:00,458 --> 00:00:02,128
(Sheldon:)about what happened
earlier between us.

2
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:05,731
(Sheldon:)Also, I had one heck of a bus nap.

3
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:11,545
(Sheldon:)Speaking of which, do you want
some mutton in coconut milk?

4
00:00:11,703 --> 00:00:15,553
(Penny:)-No.
-I cannot give this stuff away.

5
00:00:16,307 --> 00:00:17,907
(Amy:)What do you want?

6
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:21,326
(Sheldon:)Amy, this isn't easy to say.

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:26,150
(Sheldon:)All relationships are difficult,

8
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:28,597
(Sheldon:)but even more so
when you're in one

9
00:00:28,753 --> 00:00:32,763
(Sheldon:)with a person who struggles
with everyday social interactions

10
00:00:32,824 --> 00:00:38,534
(Sheldon:)and, frankly, who can strike some
people as being kind of a weirdo.

11
00:00:38,596 --> 00:00:42,506
(Penny:)Sheldon...
you're not a weirdo.

12
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:45,017
(Sheldon:)I wasn't speaking about me.

13
00:00:47,338 --> 00:00:51,018
(Sheldon:)I mean, honestly, there's no telling
what will set you off.

14
00:00:51,042 --> 00:00:54,022
(Sheldon:)You know, introducing myself
as your boyfriend.

15
00:00:54,078 --> 00:00:56,858
(Sheldon:)Giving you the opportunity
to drive me home.

16
00:00:56,915 --> 00:00:59,755
(Sheldon:)Breaking the ice with your colleagues
using ethnic humor,

17
00:00:59,884 --> 00:01:01,424
the funniest kind of humor.

18
00:01:03,922 --> 00:01:07,462
(Amy:)-What's your point?
-My point is, we're a couple.

19
00:01:07,559 --> 00:01:11,629
(Penny:)And...
I like you for who you are.

20
00:01:11,763 --> 00:01:12,903
(Sheldon:)Quirks and all.

21
00:01:15,433 --> 00:01:18,813
(Amy:)-I like you, too.
-Well, I should hope so.

22
00:01:19,704 --> 00:01:21,374
(Sheldon:)I don't see anyone else
banging on this door

23
00:01:21,472 --> 00:01:23,452
(Sheldon:)to put up with your nonsense.

24
00:01:28,146 --> 00:01:30,256
(Sheldon:)Not even a good-bye?

25
00:01:30,381 --> 00:01:33,731
(Sheldon:)You see, that's the kind of thing
that makes people think you're weird.

26
00:01:33,751 --> 00:01:34,961
Go away.

27
00:01:35,053 --> 00:01:36,963
(Sheldon:)Poor kid.

28
00:01:37,088 --> 00:01:39,468
(Sheldon:)She just doesn't see it.

29
00:01:44,262 --> 00:01:45,802
(Bernadette:)I'm not apologizing to Howard.

30
00:01:45,897 --> 00:01:47,777
(Bernadette:)He can come beg me on his knees.

31
00:01:47,899 --> 00:01:50,349
(Amy:)Sheldon, too. If I see him at work,
I'm just going to ignore him.

32
00:01:50,468 --> 00:01:52,348
(Penny:)All right, don't worry.
I talked to Leonard.

33
00:01:52,503 --> 00:01:54,953
(Penny:)He is gonna sit the guys down
and set them straight.

34
00:01:55,006 --> 00:01:57,246
(Leonard:)Laser's warmed up.

35
00:01:57,742 --> 00:01:59,022
Pull!

